  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mob_Souls/MP_MobSouls_header.webp\"></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mob_Souls/MP_MobSouls_description.webp\"></strong></p><h2><strong>&nbsp;</strong></h2><ul>\n<li>「Mob Souls」新增了5個等級的靈魂，您可以從擊殺怪物中提取。</li>\n<li>和平靈魂：來自被動型怪物。</li>\n<li>另外4個等級的敵對靈魂：從各種敵對怪物中獲得。</li>\n<li>每個靈魂可用於多種合成配方，以製作出不同類型的怪物掉落物。</li>\n<li>未來將針對更高級別的怪物掉落物（如終界龍與凋零怪靈魂）加入更多自訂物品。</li>\n<li>下方圖片展示了一些合成範例！（建議使用JEI或其他替代模組檢視。）</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ce383d58-db30-4173-886a-8afe45b1d65b.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2099e58f-5009-4212-b404-d2c23fba5f69.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fafffc7e-18c7-4e85-b7ff-d1a0a2707737.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a17e05df-27df-4877-8c5f-c04bc7a47c37.png\"></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_78ee3202-fe2b-424e-adc9-1fd4791f0f20.png\"></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0293383b-2ba3-49f7-b4f7-af3fbeaf07bb.png\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/christianbutnot/justanotherlibrarymod/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Another_Library/BH_Just_Another_Library_developers.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1401\" height=\"151\"></strong></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mob_Souls/MP_MobSouls_discord.webp\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mob_Souls/MP_MobSouls_x.webp\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mob_Souls/MP_MobSouls_promo.webp\"></p>",
